Disk Alert

=> Create nano disk_alert.py

Program:

disk_usage = int(input("Enter disk usage percentage: "))

if disk_usage >= 90:
    print("CRITICAL: Disk usage is very high")
elif disk_usage >= 80:
    print("WARNING: Disk usage is high")
else:
    print("OK: Disk usage is normal")

Run:
python3 disk_alert.py

Test:
Enter disk usage percentage: 95
CRITICAL: Disk usage is very high

Then:
Enter disk usage percentage: 85
WARNING: Disk usage is high

Then:
Enter disk usage percentage: 50
OK: Disk usage is normal
